Z||000000||Jaygee79||06-10-2001||08:16 PM||||It was a great day for a car show.  Our club photographer was there so we should have plenty of good pics   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  The only thing was that they stuck us in the sunniest part of the field.  Josh and I went on the brewery tour with Les.  That was fun and we got some samples   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Here are the winners:<P>Notchback class:<P>1st - Andy & Lisa Virzi<BR>2nd - Josh Bumpus<BR>3rd - Les Sandy<P>Fastback class:<P>1st - Jody Lemos<BR>2nd - Rob & Renee Dabrowski<BR>3rd - Russell Kelley<P>------------------<BR>Jaime<BR>84SE red<BR>AOL IM: Jaygee79<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Jaygee79's Web Page</A><BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pooheey1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Jaygee79 (edited 06-10-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||06-11-2001||11:48 AM||||It was a great show. unfortunately my pics came out really bad. I hope to get some good ones to post soon. I think the best part of the day was the free beer on the tour <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.<P>Here are my crapy pics.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=13234099&p=50188370&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=13234099&p=50188371&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=13234099&p=50188366&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
